@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/catalog> a dcat:Catalog ;
    dcat:dataset <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/integration/2.0.0> .

<https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/integration/2.0.0> a dcat:Dataset ;
